  <div class="field field--name-field-content field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__items">
        <div class="field__item"><h2>University Profile</h2>
<p>A summary of general university information and data.</p>
<p><em>All of the documents below are in a PDF format and open in a new window unless otherwise indicated.</em></p>
<p><a href="https://www.dom.edu/sites/default/files/2025-12/OIE_Dominican_University_Profile_FA25_FINAL_12_2_25.pdf" target="_blank">Fall 2025 University Profile</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.dom.edu/sites/default/files/2025-03/Dominican%20University%20Profile%20-%20FA24_FINAL_1_19_25.pdf" target="_blank">Fall 2024 University Profile</a></p>
<h2>Common Data Set</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.dom.edu/sites/default/files/2026-01/OIE_CDS_2025-2026_Final_12_11_25.pdf" target="_blank">Common Data Set 2025-2026</a></p>
<p>Additional reports, including historical versions of the ones presented here, are available in the&nbsp;<a href="https://mydomedu.sharepoint.com/sites/oir">OIE document library</a> <em>(login required)</em>, accessible to Dominican University community members only.</p>
</div>
